    <string name="mushaf_page_description">Mushaf sahifasi. O‘qish tugmalarini ko‘rsatish yoki yashirish uchun teging. Oyatni tanlash uchun yarim soniya bosib turing; uning amallarini ochish uchun taxminan bir soniya ushlab turing. Keyingi sahifa uchun o‘ngga, oldingi sahifa uchun chapga suring.</string>
    <string name="reader_gesture_help">Tugmalarni ko‘rsatish yoki yashirish uchun sahifaga teging. Oyatni tanlash uchun yarim soniya bosib turing; amallarini ochish uchun ushlab turishda davom eting. Sahifalarni o‘ngga yoki chapga surib almashtiring.</string>
    <string name="quran_svg_attribution">Quran.ws — mushaf sahifalari va oyat joylashuvlarini taqdim etuvchi mustaqil loyiha. Uning hujjatlarida Hafs sahifalari manbasi sifatida Qirol Fahd Qur’on chop etish majmuasining hijriy 1441-yilgi mushafi ko‘rsatilgan.\nhttps://github.com/quran-ws/quran-svg</string>
